From 2387ea0b1735d7fe1bb497bac88b8473811f2647 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 12:11:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] MERGE-56bbf785 (web): laptop main 56bbf785 web files
 applied; main.html hand-merged; token fixes

Web half of the C++ MERGE-56bbf785 commit (same package, GitHub HPI-Jimmy-Chiu/HT9050 2944d3e): 52 web files from the package
(NEW/OLD), main.html three-way merged (machine P28/P29 Tools -> 1203 Setting + menu icons kept, laptop recipe.change added).
Review fixes: main.html takes the control token only for recipe.change and gives it back if it took it, no automatic list() on load,
the active recipe name stays visible when the list is refused; ht9045_recipe_client.js auth.* calls (authMode/authSelect/authLogin/
authLogout) no longer acquire() the single-operator token (the server exempts auth.*; main.html's authMode on load used to hold the
token for 10 minutes and lock the IO page / Motor Test / saves out). The laptop's token-release package (0c1d5d0) is NOT applied yet.
New wb_serve requires the new page/dialog-page.js from this commit -- both trees are one batch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
